 ## Operating characteristics
-*   **Complexity:** The method relies on a single MLP, making the per-sample evaluation cost comparable to standard NeRF, but the need to model temporal dynamics within the same network can increase the required capacity and training time compared to static NeRF.
+*   **Complexity:** The method relies on a single MLP, making the per-sample evaluation cost comparable to standard NeRF, but the need to model temporal dynamics within the same network can increase the required capacity and training time compared to static NeRF [G].
